    { c: 'Slides', t: 'Week 8 deck (24 slides, Dr. Kassaye with Dr. McAteer)', s: 'climate · early commitment · orientation vs socialization · five orientation benefits · slide 17 who-uses-which · Pascale’s steps (slide 23) · seven proactive behaviours (slide 24)' }
